#: lib/Snapshot/View/Metabox/Admin.php:2489
msgid "This section controls how Snapshot will handle an error condition during the backup / restore processing. There are two columns for each type of error. The 'stop' column controls if Snapshot will abort the current process should that type of error be reached. The 'log' column controls if the type of error and details will be written to the processing log. In most cases you want to set 'stop' for Errors only. And set 'log' for all."
